### Known quirks and fixes

Numbered, each with the symptom, the cause, the fix and where the fix lives, so the next agent does not rediscover it.

1. `<symptom>`. Cause: `<cause>`. Fix: `<what was changed>`, in `<file>`. Verified `<date>` with `<command>`.

