### Owner preferences

1. `<preference an agent cannot discover, for example which shell to give commands for, or what never to install>`.

---

### Needs root

Facts this file is missing because reading them needs elevation. The owner runs these and pastes the output, or an agent records the answer the owner gives.

```text
needs: sudo <command>   (fills: <section and row>)
```

---

### Change log

Newest first. Every change an agent makes or witnesses on this machine: date, what, why, how to undo.

#### `<YYYY-MM-DD>`

1. `<what changed>`. Why: `<reason>`. Undo: `<command or steps>`.
